Hello World!

Examples
--------

examples/scrape_to_json.py scrapes a page with Firecrawl and prints structured
JSON, using the scrape endpoint's `json` extraction format.

    pip install -r examples/requirements.txt
    export FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=fc-...
    python examples/scrape_to_json.py https://example.com

Get an API key at https://firecrawl.dev; the API is documented at
https://docs.firecrawl.dev.
